---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Mount M Technologies and Michael Mowery.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
      <h1>Mount M Technologies</h1>
      <p class="lead">A small development studio in Telluride, Colorado, run by Michael Mowery.</p>
      <p>Mount M Technologies, LLC was formed in Colorado in 2008. Its early work was websites and IT support for local businesses under the Telluride Tech name. Today it focuses on apps and websites, for clients and as its own products.</p>
      <p>Pairody and Noodlit are two of those products: playful, polished apps that run on the web and are heading to the App Store and Google Play. The same care goes into every client project, whether it's a Shopify store, a WordPress site or a custom tool.</p>
      <p>Outside of work, Michael writes about Telluride, travel and cooking at <a href="https://meander.me">MeanderMe</a>.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:mountmtech@gmail.com">Say hello</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
